Ready-made thematic flash cards will help you easily learn English and actively improve your vocabulary. Memorize new English words and expand your vocabulary!

With the help of flashcards, learning new English words becomes more fun. This is an excellent English language tutorial for those who are already learning English or just starting to learn.

With our application it is simple and interesting:
- picture, high-quality voice acting, transcription and meaning;
- cards with words are conveniently divided into topics: family, home, food, nature, etc.;
- a list of cards with English words to study;
- flashcards with images, where you can take a quick test for self-examination of the learned words;
- assignments where you can practice the new learned English words;
- percentage of correct answers and best result

The spaced repetition method will help you learn words effectively. This means that cards with the same words must be repeated several times a day.

It is important not only to read the words, but also to pronounce them, in order not only to fix the spelling, but the sound, to translate English words into an active dictionary.

Download the app today and start learning English in a fun and easy way using flashcards!

